## Context

Apply the 0716 contract to the South African JETP from the 2021 declaration up
to the collection date. Cover the JET IP, JET Implementation Plan, progress
reports, public registers, IPG, funders, Eskom and every identified project or
financial programme.

## Test

The coverage check fails until the authority matrix includes Presidency/PCC/JET
PMU, IPG, each named public funder, multilateral banks and Eskom, each with a
verdict `collected`, `not_published`, `blocked` or `not_applicable`. Every
project named in an official list must have a stable identity and at least one
source.

## Exit criteria

- [x] Official reports and lists inventoried from 2021 to the collection date
- [x] Projects and financial operations separated into dated events
- [x] Funder pages and Eskom examined; dry searches recorded
- [x] Useful secondary news attached as leads, not as evidence
- [x] South Africa coverage check passes
